OL,3,ATheatregoer who throttled woman at show
OL,4,Ais jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 75-year-old man who strangled a woman
OL,7,Fafter she started to sing along at a
OL,8,FWest End show has been jailed for two
OL,9,Fyears.
OL,11,FMalcolm Potier was sitting near victim
OL,12,FKirsty O'Donnell in the audience at We
OL,13,FWill Rock You at the London Coliseum in
OL,14,FJune 2023.
OL,16,FHe said he had no recollection of being
OL,17,Fat the show, or of attacking O'Donnell,
OL,18,Fbut was sentenced at Southwark Crown
OL,19,FCourt on Thursday after being found
OL,20,Fguilty of non-fatal strangulation by
OL,21,Fjurors.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,168,160,200,105,0,100
