OL,3,ATheatregoer who throttled woman at show
OL,4,Ais jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FPotier, a businessman and surveyor of
OL,7,FSarratt near Watford, was already
OL,8,Fjailed in Australia two decades ago
OL,9,Fhaving twice tried to arrange the
OL,10,Fmurder of a former partner following a
OL,11,Fdispute over their child.
